    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Review the following GitHub pull request and produce a concise, actionable code review.\n\nPR #{{$json.prNumber}}: {{$json.title}}\nAuthor: {{$json.author}}\nBranch: {{$json.headBranch}} -> {{$json.baseBranch}}\nFiles changed: {{$json.changedFiles}} | +{{$json.additions}} / -{{$json.deletions}}\nDiff URL: {{$json.diffUrl}}\n\nPR description:\n{{$json.body}}\n\nStatic validation notes (already flagged, do not repeat unless relevant):\n{{JSON.stringify($json.staticIssues)}}\n\nReturn a JSON object only (no markdown, no code fences) with this shape:\n{\n  \"summary\": \"one paragraph overview of what this PR does\",\n  \"riskLevel\": \"LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH\",\n  \"strengths\": [\"...\"],\n  \"concerns\": [\"...\"],\n  \"suggestedNextSteps\": [\"...\"]\n}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a senior software engineer performing pull request reviews. Always respond with a single valid JSON object only."
        }
      },
      "id": "6a1963c4-c488-408f-ba50-ba8a0a2ee5c5",
      "name": "Generate AI PR Review",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
